## Testing Conventions

@testing_conventions [
  {
    "convention": "mock_dependencies",
    "description": "Mock related dependencies to return different scenarios",
    "implementation": "Use @Mock annotations and Mockito.when() for setup"
  },
  {
    "convention": "exception_verification",
    "description": "Mock exceptions/errors and verify method handles situations appropriately",
    "tools": ["Mockito.doThrow()", "AssertJ.assertThatThrownBy()"]
  },
  {
    "convention": "interaction_verification",
    "description": "Verify dependencies interaction using Mockito.verify()",
